---
// Problem section — why solo habit apps fail, styled as a failed checklist
---

<section class="problem section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-grid reveal">
      <div class="problem-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">The real problem</span>
        <h2>You don't fail because you lack tools. You fail because you're <em>alone</em>.</h2>
        <p class="problem-lead">
          Every habit app gives you reminders, charts, and streaks. None of it
          matters when the only person you let down is yourself.
        </p>
        <p class="problem-turn">
          TinyAct changes the equation: <strong>when your partner's streak
          depends on you, skipping is not an option.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fail-list" role="list" aria-label="Why solo habit apps fail">
        <div class="fail-item" role="listitem">
          <span class="fail-mark" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
          <div class="fail-text">
            <h3>Reminders you ignore</h3>
            <p>Notifications become noise. There is no consequence for swiping them away.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fail-item" role="listitem">
          <span class="fail-mark" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
          <div class="fail-text">
            <h3>Streaks nobody sees</h3>
            <p>Breaking a private streak costs nothing. There is no social weight to letting yourself down.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fail-item" role="listitem">
          <span class="fail-mark" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
          <div class="fail-text">
            <h3>Skipping is painless</h3>
            <p>When no one is counting on you, "tomorrow" always sounds reasonable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fail-item" role="listitem">
          <span class="fail-mark" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
          <div class="fail-text">
            <h3>Goals that fade</h3>
            <p>Without external accountability, motivation fades after the first week.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fail-caption">
          <span class="stamp">EVERY OTHER HABIT APP · DAY 08 · ABANDONED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem {
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .problem-copy .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .problem-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .problem-copy em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--coral-deep);
  }

  .problem-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .problem-turn {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
  }

  .problem-turn strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fail-list {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .fail-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .fail-item + .fail-item {
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
  }

  .fail-mark {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--coral-tint);
    color: var(--coral-text);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .fail-text h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(214, 69, 51, 0.4);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
  }

  .fail-text p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .fail-caption {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-10);
    }
  }
</style>
